-50元3D打印券</font><br /><br />（6）需在专属活动页创建工程，项目默认开源展示（自选开源协议），已开源项目官方有权在其新媒体平台宣传展示<br /><br />（7）投稿项目须是原创项目，鼓励将符合活动主题的私有项目开源，无电路特性的项目不可投稿此活动，官方参考案例不可以进行复刻参赛<br /><br />（8）活动咨询：<a href=\\\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/d8d6f712619f49149cc1f181fbc69ffc.png\\\"><font color=\\\"#3232CD\\\"><b>【点击进入交流群】</b></font></a><br /><br />（9）<a href=\\\"https://docs.qq.com/doc/DTHhPZEx4ZkVDaHdo\\\"><b>点击查看活动流程文档</b></a><br /><br />（10）本活动最终解释权归立创开源硬件平台所有\",\"posts\":[],\"news\":[],\"lock_project_delete\":1,\"editor_version\":\"pro\",\"awards\":[{\"title\":\"一等奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/41d93d2d39c8417a9aea087935bf537f.png\",\"description\":\"乐鑫开发板 ESP32-S31-Korvo-1+500元京东E卡+荣誉证书+嘉立创EDA周边+300元器件券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/fed4849424d14fb5825f7faa82eb25af.png\"},{\"title\":\"二等奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/3d4aab0a52a0466a90d1258727032574.png\",\"description\":\"乐鑫开发板 ESP-VoCat 喵伴+300元京东E卡+荣誉证书+嘉立创EDA周边+200元器件券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/6369baf9cabf48d4989b442cb137a4e7.png\"},{\"title\":\"三等奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/2944c24b09c748eaa6fdc1f085734094.png\",\"description\":\"乐鑫开发板 ESP-DualKe+100元京东E卡+荣誉证书+嘉立创EDA周边+100元器件券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/95b8f44b8dac4799b5c07173aaac3c9b.png\"},{\"title\":\"鼓励奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/f2425825f1874103abcc4506cc970c0c.png\",\"description\":\"100元器件券+50元彩色丝印券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/4a53a6b1c31a4e36b3074ac730a12c58.png\"},{\"title\":\"参赛奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/0561ee65c8e843cd9e095bc71902c173.png\",\"description\":\"20-50元打样券\\n20-200元器件券\\n20-50元3D打印券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/a3458040750545e1accd29ef4f5423d1.png\"},{\"title\":\"结项奖\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/3d5477c884c74530839b8