丝印券！\",\"activityRules\":\"（1）即日起，只要在 [立创开源硬件平台] 开源工程，就送1张50元彩色丝印券，无需报名活动，发布就送！！<br /><br />（2）每人仅可领取1张，不可重复领取！<br /><br />（3）发布的项目通过开源审核即可（注：无电路设计元素、NFC卡片、洞洞板、工艺徽章、工程描述不完善的项目不支持，设计图需要用嘉立创EDA专业版设计，不支持其他软件导入的项目，已经领取过的用户不再重复赠送）<br /><br />发券时间：开源工程审核通过后系统自动发券<br />彩色券有效期：1个月<br />下单规格：10*10内，2层板，白色阻焊，沉金工艺\",\"posts\":[],\"news\":[],\"lock_project_delete\":0,\"editor_version\":\"pro\",\"awards\":[{\"title\":\"开源奖励\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/43695889015a4bbb8ad202a9d68e19f2.png\",\"description\":\"50元PCB彩色丝印优惠券\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/584f6baeb05843b49687bdc349691a4b.png\"},{\"title\":\"优质工程奖励\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/108c82418f664d6b993efc73f1408e22.png\",\"description\":\"推荐参与星火计划或推荐投稿\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/7715dd28c98e402bbe71051ec838c4fe.png\"}],\"is_shareLink\":0,\"is_payment\":0,\"open_course\":0,\"course_link\":\"\",\"link_copy\":\"\",\"coupons\":[],\"process\":[{\"title\":\"设计制作\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/b9d6e8ecc8864c33b3d13ec0594e7706.png\",\"description\":\"开启电子设计\"},{\"title\":\"发布开源\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/00e3cf28b78d43a6933d53d95fa5bf9c.png\",\"description\":\"完成设计并发布开源\"},{\"title\":\"领取奖励\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/b701ea033c7c4109936baddb40f4477b.png\",\"description\":\"领取彩色丝印券\"}],\"invitation_description\":\"\",\"competition_type\":\"\",\"background_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/958d7b574ce448d58858b68fdd806fa8.jpg\",\"right_images\":[],\"activity_code_url\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/oshwhub/pullImage/07a55f559f1941a19ee69c51ac57e3ea.jpg\",\"allow_sync_jlc\":0,\"hide_project\":0},{\"coupons\":[],\"name\":\"STC单片机开源创意电子设计大赛\",\"path\":\"STC32G144K246\",\"competition_type\":\"personal\",\"websiteSeo\":\"\",\"is_payment\":0,\"course_link\":\"\",\"open_course\":0,\"templateType\":\"1\",\"introduction\":\"基于下列官方推荐设计一款开发板或者是设计一个完整的电子产品项目。\\r\\n选手可以根据自己喜欢选择赛道（单片机赛道/项目赛道）\\r\\n\\r\\n单片机赛道：基于官方推荐的芯片去设计一个开发板\\r\\n\\r\\n项目赛道：基于官方推荐的芯片去设计一个完整的电子产品项目\\r\\n\\r\\n官方推荐芯片：STC32G144K246-LQFP100、Ai8051U-34K64-LQFP48/QFN48\",\"background_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/480192a1212e49b4964d1fc450867343.png\",\"right_images\":[\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/8adeb663d7904f3f8a3aa61086334a04.png\"],\"process\":[{\"title\":\"报名活动\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/09ceafeed08e47ffba3fbf473f0c07e4.png\",\"description\":\"报名创建工程\",\"grade\":4},{\"title\":\"设计制作\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/ecb83302fe6d4d5fbbb132f7f5b4c828.png\",\"description\":\"开启电子设计\",\"grade\":3},{\"title\":\"审核发券\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/7c549591a765497998f2b8d5c304d943.png\",\"description\":\"填写领券表领券\",\"grade\":2},{\"title\":\"发布开源\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/f592debc64dc4dda8ae23e6a84fa52fe.png\",\"description\":\"完成活动项目并成功开源\",\"grade\":1}],\"awards\":[{\"title\":\"开发板区一等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/2bf85ae517c545a88a8d4497d40c6e6f.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/b244b2f9f1194f0b8859abdc193b82bd.png\",\"description\":\"奖金500元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":8},{\"title\":\"项目区一等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/2bf85ae517c545a88a8d4497d40c6e6f.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/cc6475e913424e13bc6f0601970bc56d.png\",\"description\":\"奖金500元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":7},{\"title\":\"开发板区二等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/573cdf6906534e4bb955f9cef4c55924.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/aa2c55d9733e43fca83d64ed6e57cc1c.png\",\"description\":\"奖金300元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":6},{\"title\":\"项目区二等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/573cdf6906534e4bb955f9cef4c55924.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/aa2c55d9733e43fca83d64ed6e57cc1c.png\",\"description\":\"奖金300元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":5},{\"title\":\"开发板区三等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/8fce98d50c9d437bbca3bd259a17eff4.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/7946aaf4f4cf4e98b1238080ee474114.png\",\"description\":\"奖金100元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":4},{\"title\":\"项目区三等奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/8fce98d50c9d437bbca3bd259a17eff4.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/7946aaf4f4cf4e98b1238080ee474114.png\",\"description\":\"奖金100元+嘉立创EDA周边\",\"grade\":3},{\"title\":\"结项奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/eda85448382a4b40b6c7923b85133b72.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/bcfe310f67d24958ba90529815e669f6.png\",\"description\":\"耗材支持券包+无门槛50元彩色丝印券\",\"grade\":2},{\"title\":\"鼓励奖\",\"award_image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/4b3981f854a645ea8f7dbdf21e29daf5.png\",\"image\":\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/965b3d55657d4f07ae326981833b1a24.png\",\"description\":\"无门槛50元器件券+无门槛50元彩色丝印券\",\"grade\":1}],\"activityRules\":\"<a href=\\\"https://image.lceda.cn/easyedaResource/images/bcf916fde16044c3a9ebbc302d095d86.jpg\\\"><FONT color=#3232CD><b>点击免费领取活动芯片！免费送</b></FONT></a>\\r\\n（1）<a href=\\\"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DTHhWTVR0TVVkYkdi?tab=BB08J2\\\"><FONT color=#3232CD><b>点击填写报名领券表</b></FONT></a>\\r\\n（2）案例参考：<a href=\\\"https://www.stcaimcu.com/thread-21275-1-1.html\\\"><FONT color=#3232CD><b>芯片参考资料</b></FONT></a>\\r\\n（3）限使用<FONT color=#FF0000>嘉立创EDA专业版</FONT>参与活动，标准版不支持，活动工程是默认开源\\r\\n（4）参加活动用户完成原理图和PCB设计即可获得优惠券支持，开发板赛道可选择<FONT color=#FF0000>20-50元打样券、20-50元器件券和20-50元3D外壳券</FONT>，项目赛道可选择<FONT color=#FF0000>20-50元打样券、20-100元器件券和20-50元3D外壳券</FONT>\\r\\n（5）投稿项目须是原创项目，鼓励将符合活动主题的私有项目开源，无电路特性的项目不可投稿此活动，官方参考案例不可以进行复刻参赛\\r\\n（6）已开源项目