大小的关系如下：\\n![输出电压与可调电阻的关系.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/VTa8APGOY95ezxOPscvjwLvlkApKS6czp8FiO7Qx.jpeg)\\n\\n分别测试1.8V，3.3V与5V的电压输出（12V输入），结果如下：\\n![1685893980288.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/Mw2d7e7JwSmGPxhFVnudFyvOlp1NafCxJh92NPRm.jpeg)\\n\\n![1685893980278.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/3Pddc6j4ljMqxADBWXRpgEf7fmoBbGulZkdp53Wy.jpeg)\\n\\n![1685893980268.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/k40Gjx6Nq9f5r0beMzB1CzLuO1B3xfDPoxSOnjzA.jpeg)\\n（调整可调电阻得到电压结果有略微误差）\",\"introduction\":\"基于MT2492的迷你Buck降压模块，可以直插或贴片方式安装在PCB中。\",\"grade\":1,\"public\":true,\"license\":\"GPL 3.0\",\"text_editor_type\":\"markdown\",\"creator\":{\"uuid\":\"bd44fc34722f4b89a8a7fda0fb77ca7b\",\"username\":\"carele\",\"nickname\":\"Carele\",\"avatar\":\"//image.lceda.cn/avatars/2024/7/ugQSCJo2x80pyZIIgzXIizMsNWlmvKa19drQSUuS.png\"},\"owner\":{\"uuid\":\"bd44fc34722f4b89a8a7fda0fb77ca7b\",\"username\":\"carele\",\"nickname\":\"Carele\",\"avatar\":\"//image.lceda.cn/avatars/2024/7/ugQSCJo2x80pyZIIgzXIizMsNWlmvKa19drQSUuS.png\",\"team\":false},\"origin\":\"pro\",\"is_draft\":false,\"publish\":true,\"count\":{\"views\":4249,\"star\":25,\"fork\":0,\"watch\":0,\"like\":9},\"members\":[{\"uuid\":\"bd44fc34722f4b89a8a7fda0fb77ca7b\",\"username\":\"carele\",\"nickname\":\"Carele\",\"avatar\":\"//image.lceda.cn/avatars/2024/7/ugQSCJo2x80pyZIIgzXIizMsNWlmvKa19drQSUuS.png\",\"role\":1}],\"attachments\":[],\"no\":0,\"archive\":false,\"allow_comment\":true,\"cover\":{\"name\":\"\",\"src\":\"\"},\"version\":\"\",\"thumb\":\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/P0mVIylg547xzHIHwAEy4JvtHkGi3v1sFEoL6mtx.jpeg\",\"competition_record_uuid\":\"2edc3d08199244dbb29b501a7295685a\",\"updated_at\":\"2024-07-17T07:17:56.000Z\",\"created_at\":\"2023-05-19T15:03:42.000Z\",\"project_tags\":[\"c2e7a00699a2440ca5880a96466ee387\",\"a08b61928be54154bb1a346f7630e4ba\"],\"oshwhub_publish_at\":\"2023-06-05T01:03:46.000Z\",\"store\":false,\"updated_time\":\"2026-10-18T15:58:44.973Z\",\"oshwhub_first_publish_at\":\"2023-06-05T01:03:46.000Z\",\"for